{"id":2779,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为夯实大中小学思政课育人基础，打造思政课创新要素聚集的战略高地，推进大中小学思政课一体化建设，5月20日上午，中北大学马克思主义学院联合朔州市教育局思政课教师前往“大思政”实践基地-山西博物院开展大中小学思政课一体化集体备课会。</p><p>马克思主义学院教学副院长郭玲霞说明此次备课会目的是希望通过馆校资源互补、人员联动进行实践课程开发、教学案例设计、大思政项目合作。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5M4LCPM49PMRUYMQ4U8LRl8nzGYozvqZMzffoRWVL4CYUz-0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4U1hfUSyanzV7nzUZMzfknmCYUmLbLlLYUmUaM47ao7QFLm9bU4GiU46FLzn2LN7Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4UbMRCJqdpnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=4946&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/33BAA0E1DE4850BF62B391C2B407108F/289C05C7/14F2A\" vheight=\" 225px\" vwidth=\" 300px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5nN-CaLmNPolUDUQ4vDozfkMmWfnzNqsn7CsL8Mfoz94Uz70gihFp2hmCIa0LShRMYy8LkhVnzvZnzUaL7WVnzlanz7bU4lPL77bUz-bnNrFoRCDM8UZU4QFLNU4nm7agtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGPoky8ozUDgtA8pUpcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=4946&e=.jpg\"></p><p>山西博物院李平主任强调场馆育人，馆校要相互配合，可采用“三步走”。首先，深入挖掘山西博物院藏品中蕴含的深厚文化底蕴，将丰富的博物院资源转化为宝贵的教育资源；其次，联合高校组织学生在博物院进行现场教学；最后，探索并精心打造思政课教师与博物馆讲解员有机结合的“双师模式”，推动形成“博物馆里的‘大思政课’”的教学新模式和课堂新形态。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5L7-CPMlCZo7CinQNL4LRWVnm-sMRWq2n7-8L8MRo7V7LNC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPn1yZnSh2nzvaL4C4L8nVL4laUm-sLlL4Lm-sLRlaMzAFLmCsnm7YLlQFLzU4LmLJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4UbMRCJqdpnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=4946&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D1F8EFE703633DE350B271C322705058/267F121F/14323\" vheight=\" 225px\" vwidth=\" 300px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5nm-CZUN78MzU4nQlU8UlM7nlWRn7Vq7LNCYM4Lao7LDMl70gihFp2hmCIa0oShRU1hkMkyYLR98MNCDM4rVLzv4o7rfLmvan7r7MlLsUmVFoz6fnmAknzTFLmnVU8V2gtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGPoky8ozUDgtA8pUpcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=4946&e=.jpg\"></p><p>随后，马克思主义学院各基础教学部教师以及朔州市教育局教师就课程与博物院资源结合、“博物馆里的‘大思政课’”现场实践教学、项目合作推进以及馆校互通交流等方面进行了深入交流。</p><p>本次集体备课联动场馆资源、文化资源和人力资源，结合不同学段学情提升大中小学思政课内容供给质量，基于本地省情市情以大中小学思政课为基点“讲好山西故事”，切实提升思政课针对性与实效性，形成建设“博物馆里的‘大思政课’”三维合力，共同抒写新时代“大思政课”建设答卷。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5U4lCiM7UiMm7anQNl8UNUiUmMfMzCqbLz9inmW7nRGanmU0gihFp2hmCIa0oSybM1y4nSyiUm62LmfkMlnVn7UbnzQ2U47aL77bolLYnlrFMz7aMlUPM4QFLlCaMlLJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4UbMRCJqdpnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=4946&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9963E5B7F20B5DEDD9E6FC100A99C2EE/5105D176/1F05C\" vheight=\" 225px\" vwidth=\" 300px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5M8rCfnN7boR9PLQlLDL8-sMlLsM8Vq7nRG8nRlsM4vZUmL0gihFp2hmCIa0L1ysL1yanky8MzC4M7LZMmLiL4GYMlV2nz74U8LaMN-PLzrFMRfknNn2UmrFMz-YLmLJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4UbMRCJqdpnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=4946&e=.jpg\"></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5M4LCPM49PMRUYMQ4U8LRl8nzGYozvqZMzffoRWVL4CYUz-0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4U1hfUSyanzV7nzUZMzfknmCYUmLbLlLYUmUaM47ao7QFLm9bU4GiU46FLzn2LN7Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4UbMRCJqdpnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=4946&e=.jpg"}